{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "container-scroll",
  "title": "容器滚动",
  "description": "用于随页面滚动对卡片内容做旋转缩放过渡的首屏展示组件。",
  "category": "misc",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "aceternity-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "rotate",
      "type": "number",
      "default": "0",
      "required": false,
      "description": "控制滚动时内层内容的旋转。"
    },
    {
      "name": "scale",
      "type": "number",
      "default": "1",
      "required": false,
      "description": "控制滚动时内容的缩放。"
    },
    {
      "name": "translate",
      "type": "number",
      "default": "0",
      "required": false,
      "description": "控制标题的垂直位移。"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "card",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "default",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/container-scroll/ContainerScrollDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "落地页首屏产品截图随滚动展开的 hero 动画。",
    "标题 + 大图卡片组合、由滚动进度驱动的展示区块。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "滚动驱动的文字逐词揭示，改用 text-scroll-reveal。",
    "沿内容侧边跟随滚动的光束线条，改用 tracing-beam。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，依赖 @vueuse/core。",
    "内容通过 title 与 card 插槽传入（配套 ContainerScrollTitle / ContainerScrollCard 子组件）。",
    "rotate / scale / translate 分别控制内容旋转、缩放与标题位移的幅度，效果由滚动进度驱动。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    "@vueuse/core"
  ],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add container-scroll"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
